  "commit_message": "fix(deployment): update ubuntu-binary-mapper resources to 2 CPU / 4G limit (1 CPU / 2G req) (#6114)\n\n## Summary\nUpdates resource requests and limits for the `ubuntu-binary-mapper` GKE\nCronJob under\n`deployment/clouddeploy/gke-workers/base/extra/ubuntu-binary-mapper.yaml`.\n- Requests: `cpu: \"1\"`, `memory: \"2G\"`\n- Limits: `cpu: \"2\"`, `memory: \"4G\"`\n\nThis provides sufficient CPU and memory headroom for uncompressing and\nprocessing `Ubuntu/all.zip` without risking OOMKills.\n\nagy",
